#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plans overview {#plans-overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan pelan {#plans-overview}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Platform has Open (free access) and paid plans, as described below. See [IBM Quantum access plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) for full details. Note that usage for all plans is  tracked in [_resource units (RUs)_](#rus).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Platform menawarkan pelan Open (akses percuma) dan pelan berbayar, seperti yang diterangkan di bawah. Lihat [pelan akses IBM Quantum](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) untuk maklumat penuh. Perhatikan bahawa penggunaan bagi semua pelan dijejak dalam [_unit sumber (RU)_](#rus).\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want access to multiple plans, you can create multiple instances and assign different plans to them.  For example, you can have an Open Plan instance and a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance.  You can set preferred instances to use in the `QiskitRuntimeService` initializer or `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()` method.  Example:\n"
msgstr "Jika anda mahu akses kepada berbilang pelan, anda boleh mencipta berbilang instance dan menetapkan pelan berbeza kepada setiap satu. Contohnya, anda boleh mempunyai instance Pelan Open dan instance Pelan Pay-As-You-Go. Anda boleh menetapkan instance pilihan untuk digunakan dalam pemula `QiskitRuntimeService` atau kaedah `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`. Contoh:\n"

