# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resource units {#resource-units}"
msgstr "Unit sumber {#resource-units}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As of November 2026, IBM Quantum Platform is expanding beyond access to quantum processing units (QPUs) to offer additional services, including functions and managed workflows that bring quantum and classical computing together.\n"
msgstr "Mulai November 2026, IBM Quantum Platform berkembang melangkaui akses kepada unit pemprosesan kuantum (QPU) untuk menawarkan perkhidmatan tambahan, termasuk fungsi dan aliran kerja terurus yang menggabungkan pengkomputeran kuantum dan klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To support these capabilities, IBM Quantum is introducing Resource Units (RUs), a flexible unit for measuring and managing resource consumption across different services.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menyokong keupayaan ini, IBM Quantum memperkenalkan Unit Sumber (RU), iaitu unit fleksibel untuk mengukur dan mengurus penggunaan sumber merentasi pelbagai perkhidmatan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For standard QPU workloads, 1 RU = 1 minute of QPU compute time. For Premium Plan customers, 1 RU is equivalent to 1 Value Unit (VU) for standard QPU workloads. This means there are no changes to current QPU pricing or existing contracts, although capacity and usage are now displayed in RUs.\n"
msgstr "Untuk beban kerja QPU standard, 1 RU = 1 minit masa pengiraan QPU. Bagi pelanggan Pelan Premium, 1 RU setara dengan 1 Value Unit (VU) untuk beban kerja QPU standard. Ini bermakna tiada perubahan pada harga QPU semasa atau kontrak sedia ada, walaupun kapasiti dan penggunaan kini dipaparkan dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Different services might consume RUs at different rates depending on the resources used.\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan yang berbeza mungkin menggunakan RU pada kadar yang berbeza bergantung pada sumber yang digunakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Dry-run jobs\">\n"
"[Dry-run jobs](/guides/dry-run-jobs) do not consume RUs. A dry-run job reports the usage in RUs that the same job would incur on a real QPU, but that usage is not charged, does not consume your plan allocation, and does not count against any limits. Dry-run jobs are available on the Flex, Premium, and On-Prem plans.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Job dry-run\">\n"
"[Job dry-run](/guides/dry-run-jobs) tidak menggunakan RU. Sesuatu job dry-run melaporkan penggunaan dalam RU yang akan dikenakan oleh job yang sama pada QPU sebenar, tetapi penggunaan itu tidak dicaj, tidak menggunakan peruntukan pelan anda, dan tidak dikira terhadap sebarang had. Job dry-run tersedia pada pelan Flex, Premium, dan On-Prem.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan {#open-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Open {#open-plan}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run your quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free (the RU equivalent of up to 10 minutes per 28-day rolling window). You can track your usage on the [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.  Open Plan instances can only be created in the us-east region (you can switch regions from the drop-down menu at the top of the Platform dashboard). [Click to go the sign-up page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"
msgstr "Jalankan litar kuantum anda pada QPU terbaik di dunia secara percuma (setara RU bagi sehingga 10 minit setiap tempoh bergulir 28 hari). Anda boleh menjejak penggunaan anda pada halaman [Papan pemuka Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) dan halaman [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).  Instans Pelan Open hanya boleh dicipta di rantau us-east (anda boleh menukar rantau daripada menu juntai bawah di bahagian atas papan pemuka Platform). [Klik untuk pergi ke halaman pendaftaran](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are learning quantum computing and exploring IBM quantum technology.\n"
msgstr "Pelan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang sedang belajar pengkomputeran kuantum dan meneroka teknologi kuantum IBM.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limited time promotion\">\n"
"As of 16 March 2026, active Open Plan users can opt in to the RU equivalent of an additional 180 minutes over the next 12 months.\n"
"Read the [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) blog for full details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Promosi masa terhad\">\n"
"Mulai 16 Mac 2026, pengguna Pelan Open yang aktif boleh memohon setara RU bagi tambahan 180 minit dalam tempoh 12 bulan akan datang.\n"
"Baca blog [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) untuk maklumat penuh.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Flex {#flex-plan}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pre-purchase a certain number of RUs (equivalent to 400 or more minutes) for running quantum jobs, to be used within one year of purchase.  You can purchase more RUs at any time.\n"
msgstr "Beli terlebih dahulu bilangan RU tertentu (setara dengan 400 minit atau lebih) untuk menjalankan job kuantum, untuk digunakan dalam tempoh satu tahun dari tarikh pembelian. Anda boleh membeli lebih banyak RU pada bila-bila masa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After purchasing RUs, you must allocate them to existing or new instances on the Flex Plan for your account.  Set or update allocation limits on the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) or set the allocation when you [create a new Flex Plan instance](/guides/instances).  If you allocate all of the RUs to existing instances, you can't create a new instance for the Flex Plan until you purchase more RUs or remove some RUs from another instance's allocation. See [Set instance allocation limits](allocation-limits) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Selepas membeli RU, anda perlu memperuntukkannya kepada instans sedia ada atau baharu pada Pelan Flex untuk akaun anda.  Tetapkan atau kemas kini had peruntukan pada [halaman Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) atau tetapkan peruntukan semasa anda [mencipta instans Pelan Flex baharu](/guides/instances).  Jika anda memperuntukkan semua RU kepada instans sedia ada, anda tidak boleh mencipta instans baharu untuk Pelan Flex sehingga anda membeli lebih banyak RU atau mengeluarkan beberapa RU daripada peruntukan instans lain. Lihat [Tetapkan had peruntukan instans](allocation-limits) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you need more than the RU equivalent of 10,000 minutes, you should consider a Premium Plan subscription instead. \n"
msgstr "Jika anda memerlukan lebih daripada setara RU bagi 10,000 minit, anda patut mempertimbangkan langganan Pelan Premium.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't want to purchase RUs equivalent to 400 or more minutes, consider the Pay-As-You-Go Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda tidak mahu membeli RU yang setara dengan 400 minit atau lebih, pertimbangkan Pelan Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up for a Flex Plan.\n"
msgstr "[Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk mendaftar Pelan Flex.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Pay-As-You-Go {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs and pay only for the QPU consumption you use.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan litar kuantum pada QPU terbaik di dunia dan bayar hanya untuk penggunaan QPU anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are performing quantum utility research projects and testing business models with flexible access. If you will be using at least 400 minutes in the next year, it is recommended that you use the Flex Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Pelan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang menjalankan projek penyelidikan utiliti kuantum dan menguji model perniagaan dengan akses yang fleksibel. Jika anda akan menggunakan sekurang-kurangnya 400 minit dalam tahun hadapan, adalah disyorkan agar anda menggunakan Pelan Flex.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Premium {#premium-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs using an enterprise subscription. Additionally, some functionality, such as [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), is available to Premium Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan litar kuantum pada QPU terbaik di dunia menggunakan langganan peringkat enterprise. Selain itu, beberapa fungsi, seperti [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), tersedia untuk pengguna Pelan Premium.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who want to execute a strategic quantum roadmap and develop quantum algorithms and applications at scale. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Pelan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang ingin melaksanakan peta jalan kuantum strategik dan membangunkan algoritma serta aplikasi kuantum pada skala besar. [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan On-Prem {#on-prem-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access an entirely dedicated on-premises quantum system that is serviced and maintained by IBM Quantum.\n"
msgstr "Akses sistem kuantum dalam premis yang sepenuhnya khusus (dedicated), yang diservis dan diselenggarakan oleh IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This service is recommended for those who are exploring classical quantum algorithms and applications and need high control over their resources and data. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang meneroka algoritma dan aplikasi klasikal-kuantum serta memerlukan kawalan tinggi ke atas sumber dan data mereka. [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Compare available plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Understand what counts as [usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Learn about the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Access plans by creating [instances](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Upgrade from the Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  -  [Bandingkan pelan yang tersedia](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Fahami apa yang dikira sebagai [penggunaan](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Ketahui tentang [penjadual fair-share](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Akses pelan dengan mencipta [instance](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Naik taraf daripada Pelan Open](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
